commit c021ef45e7f3b724ed38a9203add940cf775ca4f

C03: volume requests accept «suví», «poné/ponelo», an absolute level after a direction verb, the pronoun mute and a lateness frame (AUDIO1239 repair)

«baja el volumen a 30» and «poné el volumen al 30» set the level; «ponelo en
mute»/«dejalo en mute» are the global mute; «suvi el volumen» and «es tarde
bajá el volumen» reach the existing amount clarification (owner rule H0027:
a relative request without a quantity asks how much). Offline recogniser
baseline: seven literals gain a reading, none lost. No tests (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


